Once your submitted videos are approved by the review team, each new view on the original platform (YouTube/TikTok) will be recorded. For every 1 new view, you will earn 1 Robling reward. The Robling you earn will be added to your Earning Balance, and you can claim your rewards whenever you want.

The data usually updates every hour, but there might be a slight delay sometimes.

---------------------------------
Extra Note:
*Reward starts when the video is submitted and approved on Blox World Channel, the previous views of the video would not be included. 
*If you remove the video from Blox World, the video stops generate rewards, but you can still claim the rewards already generated.
*Blox World uses its own algorithm to filter repeated and fake views, your video views might be different from the views on the video platforms. 
*Blox World may apply limits over the maximum reward a video can get.
*Certain actions may lead to account banning and reward removal, for example faking views, using other people's videos, spamming videos and etc.
*Blox World may change the rules in the future. By using the app, you agree to follow the rules and any future changes.�o这是由您的视频生成的Robling奖励。

一旦您提交的视频通过审核团队的批准，原平台（YouTube/TikTok）上的每一个新查看都会被记录。每获得1个新查看，您将赚取1个Robling奖励。您赚取的Robling将被添加到您的赚取余额中，您可以随时领取您的奖励。

数据通常每小时更新一次，但有时可能会有轻微的延迟。

---------------------------------
额外通知：
* 奖励从视频在Blox World频道提交并批准后开始，视频之前的查看次数不包括在内。
* 如果您从Blox World移除视频，视频将停止生成奖励，但您仍然可以领取已生成的奖励。
* Blox World使用自己的算法过滤重复和虚假查看，您的视频查看次数可能与视频平台上的查看次数不同。
* Blox World可能会对视频可以获得的最大奖励应用限制。
